    "naming_convention_prompt": "## Lab Naming Convention\n\nThis laboratory uses non-standard population names. You MUST use these exact names in your hierarchy:\n\n- **Prexilox Subset**: defined by `SSC-A vs FSC-A`\n- **Wumbus Cells**: defined by `FSC-W vs FSC-A`\n- **Snorfalax Population**: defined by `CD45+ Live/Dead-`\n- **Zymbrix Subset**: defined by `TCR\u03b2+ CD4/CD19+`\n- **Glorp Cells**: defined by `CD62L+ CD44lo`\n- **Zorphan Population**: defined by `CD62L+ CD44hi`\n- **Splonix Subset**: defined by `CD62L- CD44hi`\n- **Qwelnar Cells**: defined by `CD25+ Foxp3-`\n- **Grindlax Cells**: defined by `CD25+ Foxp3+`\n- **Vondrak Cells**: defined by `ICOS+ CD44+`\n- **Plixnor Cells**: defined by `CXCR5+`\n- **Flurbigan Cells**: defined by `ICOS+ PD-1+`\n- **Grimblex Cells**: defined by `Foxp3+`\n- **Threxix Population**: defined by `TCR\u03b2- CD19+`\n- **Quixar Subset**: defined by `Synd-1+`\n- **Blixtar Subset**: defined by `MHC II+ IgM+`\n- **Vexilon Population**: defined by `Synd-1-`\n- **Krondule Cells**: defined by `CD80+ PD-L2+`\n- **Zanthrex Population**: defined by `IgM+ IgD-`\n- **Frimblax Population**: defined by `IgM+ IgD+`\n- **Morglian Cells**: defined by `CD80+ PD-L2-`\n- **Nimbular Cells**: defined by `MHC II+ PD-L2-`\n- **Flonkian Subset**: defined by `IgM+ IgD+`\n- **Blemfark Cells**: defined by `TCR\u03b2- CD4/CD19-`\n\nUse standard names (Singlets, Lymphocytes, Live) for QC gates only.\n",
